{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1371.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"1250e6983e7c08cf647991af506e867cd112d7c2b2bb7529cf1bfa92a2d6db8e","ja":"うれしい悲鳴","zh":"甜蜜的烦恼","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1371.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"bf9a3637558dbe14af710a7189179200cd3749f84eee9a6e9f753d60fe84e58b","ja":"映画の宣伝のため、\n5人は連日取材を受けていて……","zh":"为了宣传电影，\n5人连日接受采访……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1371.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"e7380a570b559e69175d29778a86b5a04cfa096519c40f228d45e86151f7af3d","ja":"撮影で大変だったこと、ですか？　えっと……\n今回の役は、性格に裏表があったことでしょうか。","zh":"拍摄时辛苦的地方，是吗？那个……\n应该是这次的角色性格表里不一吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1371.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"50e1e79d8269f61af2538379b8253a5e923a2c97ce9590ff761651b47a6ca43b","ja":"頭がこんがらがっちゃったりして……だから\n頭を休めるために、休憩中に歌ったりしてました！","zh":"脑袋都乱成一团了……所以\n为了让大脑休息，休息时间里我就一直在唱歌！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1371.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"d17f2702aa782ebc64ef5bdc546868326176faaec5ba1cac90504d33eec5cd70","ja":"そういえば休憩のときに、気分転換してきますって\nよく外に行ってたっけ。あれは歌いに行ってたんだね。","zh":"说起来休息的时候，你经常说着要去转换一下心情\n就跑到外面去呢。原来那是去唱歌了呀。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1371.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"0b317caa0f27145a3e552b2cc03cc411dd0f54d4a0cc6cafbc2d5ea609c0b369","ja":"はい。外で大きな声を出すと、\nすっごく気持ちがいいんですよ♪","zh":"是的。在外面大声喊出来的话，\n心情就会特别舒畅哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1371.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"e69d78f28b107d654813552152f29bfbe9555538c76e760ad07ce148809fba27","ja":"「貴重なお話をありがとうございました。\n最後に、皆さんからファンの方に一言ずつ……」","zh":"“非常感谢各位分享这番宝贵的话题。\n最后，请各位对粉丝们各说一句……”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1371.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"a51dcdb638b0cd9c5ada6b3fbdb76026e577115a49660052ba2d1d09e93e8141","ja":"……ふぅ。\n次の取材までは、少し時間がありますね。","zh":"……呼。\n离下一次采访还有点时间呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1371.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"a1a2a68703ce63625e5152ed626d554374719814f13a8ebab31e0598d018535a","ja":"たくさん取材をしてもらえるのはうれしいですけど、\nスケジュールが詰め詰めだと大変ですね……。","zh":"能接受很多采访固然让人高兴，\n但日程排得太满也很不容易呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1371.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"2ea66ab9cc7cb6f0237719144448df7cb72fd72daec805f00076dcd965ab3787","ja":"それに取材がいっぱいで、話したことがあることか\nそうじゃないか、わからなくなってきました……。","zh":"而且接受了好多采访，都有点搞不清哪些是\n说过的事情，哪些是没说过的了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1371.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"61b128cc03647972f62fcd4cc6891a3c2c022072805cbb1c71195a4d14f92940","ja":"みんな大丈夫？　ゆっくり休めればいいんだけど、\n時間的にそうもいかないよね。","zh":"大家还好吗？要是能好好休息一下就好了，\n但时间上也不允许呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1371.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"c861c42773f0c4b51c833338ef5a916ad5745e30ecb13b743e991935c37e50a7","ja":"仕方ないわ。期待される映画の宿命よ。\nだからここで頑張らないと！","zh":"没办法呢。这是备受期待的电影的宿命。\n所以现在才更要加油才行！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1371.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"1d254feeae7430bf8269cde987ac83a6b051973fcf8633fb245b5796384ab6b8","ja":"でも、取材はしばらく続くからね。\nこのままもつか心配だよ……。","zh":"不过，采访还要持续一段时间呢。\n真担心能不能就这样坚持下去……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1371.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"194d3c8428d0f5cc909c12d8317a16dabfa8f941db114cf22b4ecb28bc187a39","ja":"そうだ！\nねえ、みんな！　気分転換だけでもしてみない？","zh":"我想到了！\n那个，大家！要不要哪怕只是换个心情也好？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
